    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U04-L06-ACTIVITY-009",
      "SourceSection": "6.2: Info Gap: Two Points",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Ask your partner “What specific information do you need?” and wait for your partner to ask for information. Only give information that is on your card. (Do not figure out anything for your partner!)",
